=2 Walkthrough
You must zone after completing the previous Quest.
* Speak to {p:Shantotto} (K-7) who will ask you a few questions.
** Choose the second option to the first question, "__Ask if you're worthy.__"
** Choose the second option to the next question, "__Whatchu talkin' 'bout Shantotto?__"
*** If you answer "__Yes mommy__" to the second question, your title will change to "__Total Loser__". You can get the title from the {p:Title Changer} NPC after completing this Quest, even if you did not choose this option.
* Head to the tower at (I-7) in {z:Beaucedine Glacier}, speak to {n:Torino-Samarino}, speak to him again and choose the first option to receive {@k} {k:Shantotto's new spell}.
* Head to {z:Fei'Yin}. In the basement (Map 2) at (F-6), check the north-western **Cermet Door** to get a cutscene with {n:Rukususu}.
** Using the {p:Home Point} #2 to {z:Fei'Yin} is the fastest way.
** **Note:** Be careful of how many monsters you kill in {z:Fei'Yin}. If you kill too many monsters while in posession of {@k} {k:Shantotto's new spell} before turning it in to {n:Rukususu}, the item will break and be replaced by {@k} {k:Shantotto's ex-spell}. If this happens, return to {n:Torino-Samarino} to retrieve another scroll.
* Return to {p:Shantotto} to complete the Quest and to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* The completion of this Quest is one of the requirements to obtain {p:Shantotto's Trust|BGWiki:Trusts}.

